    <string name="seal_ssh_title">SSH sync tunnel</string>
    <string name="seal_ssh_intro">Connects AnkiDroid to your self-hosted sync server through SSH. While connected, sync uses the tunnel; when you disconnect, your previous sync server and login are restored.</string>
    <string name="seal_ssh_setup_title">First-time setup (for parents)</string>
    <string name="seal_ssh_setup_steps">1. On a computer, run: ssh-keyscan -p PORT SERVER &gt; known_hosts, and check the fingerprint with the server owner.\n2. Send known_hosts (and optionally a private key) to this phone and import them below.\n3. Fill in the server, then tap Connect.\n4. Back in the deck list, log in to your self-hosted sync account once. The login is remembered for this tunnel.</string>
